415	 * Replace the body of an existing filter (`POST /edit/filter`).
416	 *
417	 * Mailcow keeps the current value for any field it receives EMPTY, so
418	 * `scriptData` must never be blank here — clearing a rule is a delete, not an
419	 * edit with an empty script.
